// NCA-AIIO 速记卡 · 领域 1：Essential AI Knowledge（中英双语）
// 每个牌组：key 稳定标识；d 领域；name/en 牌组名；cards 每张卡 [英文正面, 中文正面, 英文背面, 中文背面]
// 中文正面留空 "" 表示与英文正面相同（命令、缩写等无需翻译）。
window.AIIO_DECKS = window.AIIO_DECKS || [];

AIIO_DECKS.push({key:"ai-basics", d:1, name:"AI / ML / DL 基础概念", en:"AI / ML / DL fundamentals", cards:[
["How are AI, ML, and DL related?","AI、ML、DL 的包含关系","AI ⊃ ML ⊃ DL. ML learns patterns from data; DL is ML that uses multi-layer neural networks.","AI ⊃ ML ⊃ DL。ML 从数据学规律；DL 是用多层神经网络的 ML。"],
["Artificial Intelligence (AI)","人工智能","The umbrella term for machines showing intelligent behavior, including rule-based systems, search, and machine learning.","让机器表现出智能行为的总称，包括规则系统、搜索、机器学习等。"],
["Machine Learning (ML)","机器学习","Learning patterns from data to make predictions or decisions instead of hand-coding rules.","从数据中学习模式来做预测或决策，而不是人工写死规则。"],
["Deep Learning (DL)","深度学习","Uses deep (multi-layer) neural networks to learn features automatically; improves with more data and compute, which drives GPU demand.","用多层神经网络自动学习特征表示；数据和算力越多效果越好，是 GPU 需求的主要来源。"],
["Supervised learning","监督学习","Training data has labels (input → correct answer). Typical tasks: classification and regression.","训练数据带标签（输入→正确答案）。典型任务：分类、回归。"],
["Unsupervised learning","无监督学习","Data has no labels; the model finds structure itself. Typical tasks: clustering, dimensionality reduction, anomaly detection.","数据没有标签，模型自己发现结构。典型：聚类、降维、异常检测。"],
["Reinforcement learning","强化学习","An agent acts in an environment and learns a policy from reward signals. Used in robotics, games, and RLHF.","智能体在环境中行动，根据奖励信号学习策略。用于机器人、游戏、RLHF。"],
["Self-supervised learning","自监督学习","Builds the training signal from the data itself (e.g., predict the next token or a masked word). This is how LLMs are pretrained.","从数据本身构造监督信号（例如预测下一个 token、遮盖词），LLM 预训练就是这种方式。"],
["Classification vs regression","分类 vs 回归","Classification outputs a discrete class (cat/dog); regression outputs a continuous value (house price).","分类：输出离散类别（猫/狗）；回归：输出连续数值（房价）。"],
["Clustering","聚类","Automatically groups similar samples without labels, e.g., customer segmentation.","把相似样本自动分组，无需标签。例：客户分群。"],
["Neural network","神经网络","A model made of layers of neurons (weighted sum + activation function); its parameters are weights and biases.","由层层神经元（加权求和 + 激活函数）组成的模型，参数是权重和偏置。"],
["Weights and biases","权重与偏置","The trained parameters of a neural network. \"70B parameters\" counts these values.","神经网络中训练得到的参数。“参数量 70B”指的就是这些数值的个数。"],
["Activation function","激活函数","Adds non-linearity (ReLU, GELU, sigmoid). Without it, stacked layers collapse into one linear transform.","给网络引入非线性，例如 ReLU、GELU、Sigmoid。没有它，多层网络等价于一层线性变换。"],
["Loss function","损失函数","Measures the gap between predictions and true values; training minimizes it. Examples: cross-entropy, mean squared error.","衡量模型预测和真实值差距的函数，训练目标是最小化它。例：交叉熵、均方误差。"],
["Gradient descent","梯度下降","Updates parameters in the opposite direction of the loss gradient to reduce loss step by step.","沿损失函数梯度的反方向更新参数，逐步降低损失。"],
["Backpropagation","反向传播","Uses the chain rule to compute each parameter's gradient from the output layer backward. Core of training; not needed for inference.","用链式法则从输出层往回计算每个参数的梯度，是训练的核心步骤，推理时不需要。"],
["Optimizer","优化器","The algorithm that turns gradients into parameter updates (SGD, Adam, AdamW). Adam stores two extra states per parameter (momentum and variance).","决定如何用梯度更新参数的算法，例如 SGD、Adam、AdamW。Adam 需要额外保存两份状态（动量和方差）。"],
["Learning rate","学习率","Step size of each parameter update. Too large fails to converge; too small trains slowly.","每次参数更新的步长。太大不收敛，太小训练慢。"],
["Hyperparameter","超参数","Settings chosen before training rather than learned: learning rate, batch size, number of layers, epochs.","训练前人为设定、不由训练学习的配置：学习率、batch size、层数、epoch 数等。"],
["Epoch","","One complete pass through the training dataset.","完整遍历一次训练数据集。"],
["Batch / mini-batch","批 / 小批量","The group of samples processed in one forward and backward pass. Batch size affects memory use, throughput, and convergence.","一次前向+反向处理的一组样本。batch size 影响显存占用、吞吐和收敛。"],
["Iteration / step","迭代 / 步","Processing one mini-batch and updating parameters once. Steps per epoch = dataset size ÷ batch size.","处理一个 mini-batch 并更新一次参数。1 个 epoch = 数据量 ÷ batch size 个 step。"],
["Overfitting","过拟合","Great on training data, poor on new data because the model memorized noise. Fixes: more data, regularization, dropout, early stopping.","模型在训练集上很好、在新数据上差，记住了噪声。对策：更多数据、正则化、dropout、early stopping。"],
["Underfitting","欠拟合","The model is too simple or undertrained and performs poorly even on training data.","模型太简单或训练不够，训练集上都表现差。"],
["Training / validation / test sets","训练集 / 验证集 / 测试集","Training set learns parameters; validation set tunes hyperparameters and early stopping; test set gives the final, unseen evaluation.","训练集用于学参数；验证集调超参、早停；测试集最终评估，训练中不可见。"],
["Convolutional neural network (CNN)","卷积神经网络","Uses convolution kernels to extract local features; strong for images and video.","用卷积核提取局部特征，擅长图像和视频。"],
["RNN / LSTM","循环神经网络 / 长短期记忆网络","Process sequences step by step; used early for speech and text. Hard to parallelize over long sequences, largely replaced by Transformers.","按时间步处理序列的网络，早期用于语音和文本；长序列难并行，已大量被 Transformer 取代。"],
["Transformer","","Architecture based on self-attention that processes a whole sequence in parallel. Basis of modern LLMs and ViTs.","基于自注意力（self-attention）的架构，可并行处理整个序列。现代 LLM、ViT 都基于它。"],
["Self-attention","自注意力","Each token scores its relevance to every other token and takes a weighted sum; compute grows with the square of sequence length.","序列中每个 token 计算与其他所有 token 的相关性并加权汇总；计算量随序列长度平方增长。"],
["Foundation model","基础模型","A large model pretrained on massive data that can be adapted to many downstream tasks, e.g., LLMs and vision foundation models.","在海量数据上预训练、可适配多种下游任务的大模型，例如 LLM、视觉大模型。"],
["Generative AI","生成式 AI","Models that create new content (text, images, code, audio, video), such as LLMs and diffusion models.","生成新内容（文本、图像、代码、音频、视频）的模型，如 LLM、扩散模型。"],
["Diffusion model","扩散模型","Generates images or video by progressively denoising random noise.","通过逐步去噪从随机噪声生成图像/视频的生成模型。"],
["Agentic AI","智能体 AI","An LLM combined with planning, tool use, and memory that completes multi-step tasks autonomously.","LLM 结合规划、工具调用、记忆，能自主多步完成任务。"],
["Computer vision","计算机视觉","Machines understanding images and video: classification, detection, segmentation, tracking.","让机器理解图像和视频：分类、检测、分割、跟踪。"],
["Natural language processing (NLP)","自然语言处理","Processing human language: translation, summarization, question answering, sentiment analysis.","处理人类语言：翻译、摘要、问答、情感分析。"],
["Recommender system","推荐系统","Recommends content from user behavior; uses huge embedding tables and data. NVIDIA's framework: Merlin.","根据用户行为推荐内容；大型 embedding 表，数据量大。NVIDIA 对应 Merlin。"],
]});

AIIO_DECKS.push({key:"workflow", d:1, name:"训练、推理与 AI 工作流", en:"Training, inference & AI workflow", cards:[
["Order of the end-to-end AI workflow","AI 端到端工作流顺序","Data preparation (collect/clean/label/ETL) → training → optimization (quantize/prune/TensorRT) → deployment for inference → monitoring and retraining.","数据准备（采集/清洗/标注/ETL）→ 训练 → 优化（量化/剪枝/TensorRT）→ 部署推理 → 监控与再训练。"],
["Training","训练","Forward + backward passes that repeatedly update weights. Huge compute over long periods, usually many GPUs and nodes.","前向 + 反向传播，反复更新权重。计算量极大、持续时间长，通常多 GPU / 多节点。"],
["Inference","推理","Runs only the forward pass with fixed trained weights to produce predictions. Focus: latency, throughput, cost; runs continuously in production.","用训练好的固定权重只做前向计算，得到预测。关注延迟、吞吐、成本，长期在线运行。"],
["Hardware priorities: training vs inference","训练和推理的硬件侧重点","Training: max compute, GPU memory, fast inter-node network, fast storage. Inference: latency, throughput per watt, cost, elastic scaling.","训练：最大算力、显存容量、节点间高速网络、高速存储。推理：延迟、吞吐/瓦、成本、弹性扩缩。"],
["Pretraining","预训练","Training a foundation model from scratch on massive general data; the most expensive stage (thousands of GPUs, weeks to months).","在海量通用数据上从零训练基础模型，成本最高（成千上万 GPU、数周到数月）。"],
["Fine-tuning","微调","Continuing to train a pretrained model on domain data to adapt it to a specific task.","在预训练模型基础上用领域数据继续训练，使其适配特定任务。"],
["Transfer learning","迁移学习","Reusing knowledge learned on one task for another; fine-tuning is the most common form.","把在一个任务上学到的知识用于另一个任务，微调是最常见形式。"],
["Data preparation","数据准备","Collecting, cleaning, deduplicating, labeling, and converting data. Often the most time-consuming stage; RAPIDS can accelerate it on GPUs.","采集、清洗、去重、标注、格式转换。常是最耗时的阶段，可用 RAPIDS 在 GPU 上加速。"],
["ETL","抽取-转换-加载","Extract-Transform-Load. GPU acceleration via RAPIDS cuDF or the Spark RAPIDS Accelerator.","Extract-Transform-Load：抽取、转换、加载数据。GPU 加速可用 RAPIDS cuDF / Spark RAPIDS。"],
["Data labeling","数据标注","Attaching correct answers to samples for supervised learning.","给样本加上正确答案，供监督学习使用。"],
["Model optimization","模型优化","Shrinking and speeding up a model before deployment: quantization, pruning, distillation, layer fusion (TensorRT).","部署前减小模型、提高速度：量化、剪枝、蒸馏、层融合（TensorRT）。"],
["Pruning","剪枝","Removing unimportant weights or structures to cut model size and compute.","移除不重要的权重或结构，减小模型和计算量。"],
["Knowledge distillation","知识蒸馏","Training a small student model on a large teacher model's outputs so it approaches the teacher's quality.","用大模型（teacher）的输出训练小模型（student），小模型接近大模型效果。"],
["Batch inference vs real-time inference","批量推理 vs 实时推理","Offline batch inference maximizes throughput (e.g., nightly jobs); online real-time inference minimizes latency (chat, recommendations).","批量离线推理追求吞吐（如夜间处理数据）；实时在线推理追求低延迟（如聊天、推荐）。"],
["Latency","延迟","Time from sending one request to getting its result. A key metric for online services.","单个请求从发出到得到结果的时间。在线服务的关键指标。"],
["Throughput","吞吐","Requests, samples, or tokens processed per unit of time.","单位时间处理的请求数、样本数或 token 数。"],
["Latency vs throughput trade-off","延迟与吞吐的权衡","Larger batches raise GPU utilization and throughput, but each request waits and computes longer, so latency rises.","增大 batch 提高 GPU 利用率和吞吐，但单请求等待和计算时间变长，延迟上升。"],
["Checkpoint","检查点","Periodically saved model weights and optimizer state, so training can resume from the latest checkpoint after an interruption.","定期保存模型权重和优化器状态，训练中断后可从最近检查点恢复。"],
["Why large-scale training must checkpoint","为什么大规模训练必须做 checkpoint","With thousands of GPUs running for weeks, hardware failures are near certain; without checkpoints you restart from scratch.","上千 GPU 长时间运行，硬件故障几乎必然发生；没有 checkpoint 就要从头训练。"],
["Model drift","模型漂移","Real-world data shifts after deployment and accuracy drops; requires monitoring and retraining.","上线后真实数据分布变化导致效果下降，需要监控并再训练。"],
["MLOps","","Applying DevOps practices to ML: data/model versioning, automated training pipelines, deployment, monitoring.","把 DevOps 实践用于机器学习：数据和模型版本管理、自动训练流水线、部署、监控。"],
["Model registry","模型仓库","Stores and versions trained models with metadata for deployment.","存储和版本化训练好的模型及元数据，供部署使用。"],
["MLPerf","","Industry-standard AI benchmarks from MLCommons, with Training and Inference categories.","MLCommons 发布的行业标准 AI 基准测试，分 Training 和 Inference 等类别。"],
["Edge inference","边缘推理","Running inference near where data is produced (factory, car, camera): low latency, less bandwidth, better privacy.","在数据产生地附近（工厂、车、摄像头）推理：低延迟、省带宽、保护隐私。"],
["Data center inference vs edge inference","数据中心推理 vs 边缘推理","Data center: large models, high concurrency, central management. Edge: power/size limits, offline capable, real-time.","数据中心：大模型、高并发、集中管理；边缘：功耗和体积受限、离线可用、实时性强。"],
]});

AIIO_DECKS.push({key:"gpu-hw", d:1, name:"GPU 硬件原理", en:"GPU hardware principles", cards:[
["CPU vs GPU design goals","CPU 与 GPU 的设计取向","CPU: few powerful cores, large caches, high clocks; latency-optimized for serial, branch-heavy work. GPU: thousands of simple cores; throughput-optimized for data parallelism.","CPU：少量强核心、大缓存、高频率，延迟优化，擅长串行和复杂分支。GPU：成千上万简单核心，吞吐优化，擅长数据并行。"],
["Why GPUs suit deep learning","为什么 GPU 适合深度学习","DL is dominated by large matrix multiply-accumulate operations that split into many independent parallel operations; GPUs have many cores and high memory bandwidth.","深度学习核心是大规模矩阵乘加，可拆成大量独立运算并行执行；GPU 并行核心多、显存带宽高。"],
["Streaming Multiprocessor (SM)","流式多处理器","The GPU's basic compute unit, containing CUDA cores, Tensor Cores, registers, and shared memory/L1. A GPU has tens to hundreds of SMs.","GPU 的基本计算单元，内含 CUDA Core、Tensor Core、寄存器、共享内存/L1。GPU 由几十到上百个 SM 组成。"],
["CUDA Core","CUDA 核心","Unit that executes general scalar floating-point and integer operations.","执行通用标量浮点/整数运算的单元。"],
["Tensor Core","张量核心","Unit dedicated to matrix multiply-accumulate (MMA); introduced with Volta; the main engine of DL acceleration.","专门执行矩阵乘加（MMA）的单元，Volta 首次引入，深度学习加速的主力。"],
["RT Core","光线追踪核心","Ray-tracing unit (since Turing) for graphics rendering; unrelated to AI training — a common distractor.","光线追踪加速单元（Turing 起），用于图形渲染，与 AI 训练无关——常见干扰项。"],
["Warp","线程束","The basic GPU scheduling unit: 32 threads executing the same instruction together (SIMT).","GPU 调度的基本单位：32 个线程同时执行同一条指令（SIMT）。"],
["SIMT","单指令多线程","Single Instruction, Multiple Threads: one instruction drives many threads working on different data.","Single Instruction, Multiple Threads：一条指令驱动多个线程处理不同数据。"],
["CUDA kernel","CUDA 内核函数","A function executed in parallel on the GPU, launched as a grid → blocks → threads hierarchy.","在 GPU 上并行执行的函数，以 grid → block → thread 的层次启动。"],
["Host vs device","主机端 vs 设备端","CUDA terms: host = CPU and its memory; device = GPU and its memory.","CUDA 术语：Host = CPU 及其内存；Device = GPU 及其显存。"],
["High Bandwidth Memory (HBM)","高带宽显存","Stacked memory inside the GPU package with very high bandwidth; used by data center GPUs (A100 HBM2e, H100 HBM3, H200/B200 HBM3e).","堆叠在 GPU 封装内的高带宽显存，数据中心 GPU 使用（A100 HBM2e、H100 HBM3、H200/B200 HBM3e）。"],
["GDDR memory","GDDR 显存","On-board memory with lower bandwidth and cost than HBM; used by L4, L40S, and RTX cards.","板载显存，带宽低于 HBM、成本低。用于 L4、L40S、RTX 系列等。"],
["Memory bandwidth","显存带宽","Data read/written from GPU memory per second (TB/s). The bottleneck for memory-bound work such as LLM decode.","每秒能从显存读写的数据量（TB/s）。访存密集型任务（如 LLM decode）的瓶颈。"],
["Compute-bound vs memory-bound","计算密集 vs 访存密集","Compute-bound: limited by FLOPS (large GEMMs). Memory-bound: limited by bandwidth (element-wise ops, LLM decode).","计算密集：受 FLOPS 限制（大矩阵乘）；访存密集：受带宽限制（逐元素运算、LLM decode）。"],
["Arithmetic intensity","算术强度","Operations performed per byte moved (FLOPs/byte). Low → memory-bound; high → compute-bound.","每读写 1 字节数据做多少次运算（FLOPs/Byte）。低 → 访存瓶颈；高 → 计算瓶颈。"],
["Roofline model","屋顶线模型","An analysis model that uses arithmetic intensity to decide whether performance is capped by compute or bandwidth.","用算术强度判断性能上限是算力还是带宽的分析模型。"],
["FLOPS / TFLOPS / PFLOPS","每秒浮点运算次数","Floating-point operations per second. T = 10¹², P = 10¹⁵. When comparing, check the precision and whether sparsity is included.","每秒浮点运算次数。T = 10¹²，P = 10¹⁵。比较时要注意精度和是否含稀疏。"],
["L2 cache","二级缓存","On-chip cache shared by all SMs; MIG also partitions L2 per instance.","所有 SM 共享的片上缓存；MIG 会把 L2 也按实例切分。"],
["Shared memory","共享内存","Fast on-chip storage inside an SM shared by threads of one block; explicitly managed by the programmer.","SM 内、同一 block 线程共享的高速片上存储，程序员可显式管理。"],
["Unified Memory","统一内存","CPU and GPU share one address space; data migrates on demand, simplifying programming.","CPU 和 GPU 共用一个地址空间，数据按需自动迁移，简化编程。"],
["NVENC / NVDEC","硬件视频编码 / 解码器","Hardware video encode/decode engines on the GPU. Used for video analytics and transcoding, not training.","GPU 上的硬件视频编码 / 解码单元。视频分析、转码用，非训练用。"],
["Copy engine","拷贝引擎","GPU unit that moves data (DMA) and can overlap with computation.","GPU 上负责数据搬运（DMA）的单元，可与计算重叠。"],
["TDP / TGP","设计功耗","Designed GPU power limit. H100 SXM ≈ 700 W, H100 PCIe ≈ 350 W, L4 ≈ 72 W.","GPU 设计功耗上限。H100 SXM 约 700 W，H100 PCIe 约 350 W，L4 约 72 W。"],
["GPU Boost and throttling","GPU Boost 与降频","The GPU adjusts clocks dynamically by power and thermal headroom; overheating or hitting the power cap triggers throttling.","GPU 根据功耗、温度余量动态调整频率；过热或触及功耗上限就会降频（throttle）。"],
["Compute capability","计算能力版本","GPU architecture feature version: A100 = 8.0, Ada = 8.9, H100 = 9.0, B200 = 10.0. Compile targets (sm_XX) must match.","GPU 架构特性版本号：A100 = 8.0，Ada = 8.9，H100 = 9.0，B200 = 10.0。编译时 sm_XX 要匹配。"],
["2:4 structured sparsity","2:4 结构化稀疏","Introduced in Ampere: when 2 of every 4 weights are zero, Tensor Cores skip them for up to ~2× throughput.","Ampere 引入：每 4 个权重中 2 个为零时，Tensor Core 可跳过，最高约 2 倍吞吐。"],
["DPX instructions","DPX 指令","Hopper instructions that accelerate dynamic programming (genome alignment, route planning).","Hopper 引入的动态规划加速指令（基因组比对、路径规划等）。"],
["Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA)","张量内存加速器","Hopper hardware unit that moves large tensor blocks asynchronously, offloading the SMs.","Hopper 引入的硬件单元，异步搬运大块张量数据，减轻 SM 负担。"],
["Confidential computing","机密计算","Supported from Hopper: data in use inside the GPU is encrypted and isolated from the host and administrators.","Hopper 起支持：GPU 内数据在使用中加密隔离，防止宿主机/管理员窥探。"],
["RAS engine","RAS 引擎","Blackwell's reliability, availability, and serviceability engine for predictive fault detection and diagnostics.","Blackwell 引入的可靠性、可用性、可服务性引擎，用于预测性故障检测与诊断。"],
["Decompression engine","解压引擎","Blackwell hardware decompression engine that accelerates data analytics and database queries.","Blackwell 引入的硬件解压引擎，加速数据分析/数据库查询。"],
]});

AIIO_DECKS.push({key:"gpu-gen", d:1, name:"GPU 架构代际与产品", en:"GPU generations & products", cards:[
["Data center GPU architecture order","数据中心 GPU 架构代际顺序","Pascal → Volta → Turing → Ampere → (Ada Lovelace) → Hopper → Blackwell → Rubin (roadmap).","Pascal → Volta → Turing → Ampere → (Ada Lovelace) → Hopper → Blackwell → Rubin（路线图）。"],
["Pascal (P100, 2016)","","First-generation NVLink; HBM2.","第一代 NVLink，HBM2。"],
["Volta (V100, 2017)","","First-generation Tensor Cores; NVLink 2 (300 GB/s).","第一代 Tensor Core；NVLink 2（300 GB/s）。"],
["Turing (T4, 2018)","","INT8/INT4 Tensor Cores and RT Cores. T4 is the classic 70 W low-power inference card (16 GB).","INT8/INT4 Tensor Core、RT Core。T4 是经典 70 W 低功耗推理卡（16 GB）。"],
["Ampere (A100, 2020)","","MIG (up to 7 instances), TF32, 2:4 structured sparsity, 3rd-gen Tensor Cores, NVLink 3 (600 GB/s).","MIG（最多 7 实例）、TF32、2:4 结构化稀疏、第三代 Tensor Core、NVLink 3（600 GB/s）。"],
["A100 memory options","A100 显存规格","40 GB HBM2 (~1.6 TB/s) or 80 GB HBM2e (~2 TB/s).","40 GB HBM2（~1.6 TB/s）或 80 GB HBM2e（~2 TB/s）。"],
["A30","","Mainstream Ampere compute card, 24 GB HBM2, supports MIG (up to 4 instances).","Ampere 主流计算卡，24 GB HBM2，支持 MIG（最多 4 个实例）。"],
["A10 / A10G","","Ampere, 24 GB GDDR6, for inference and graphics; A10G is the variant in AWS g5 instances.","Ampere 24 GB GDDR6，推理与图形；A10G 是 AWS g5 实例里的变体。"],
["Ada Lovelace (L4 / L40S / RTX 40)","","4th-gen Tensor Cores with FP8; aimed at inference, graphics, and video. The RTX 4070 in this repo is Ada.","第四代 Tensor Core，支持 FP8；面向推理、图形、视频。本仓库的 RTX 4070 就是 Ada。"],
["L4","","Ada, 24 GB GDDR6, ~72 W, low-profile single slot. Efficient inference and video processing.","Ada，24 GB GDDR6，约 72 W，半高单槽。高效推理和视频处理。"],
["L40S","","Ada, 48 GB GDDR6, ~350 W. General-purpose AI (inference, small-scale training) plus graphics/Omniverse.","Ada，48 GB GDDR6，约 350 W。通用 AI（推理、小规模训练）+ 图形/Omniverse。"],
["Hopper (H100, 2022)","","Transformer Engine (FP8), 4th-gen Tensor Cores, NVLink 4 (900 GB/s), confidential computing, 2nd-gen MIG, DPX.","Transformer Engine（FP8）、第四代 Tensor Core、NVLink 4（900 GB/s）、机密计算、第二代 MIG、DPX。"],
["H100 SXM vs H100 PCIe","","SXM: 80 GB HBM3, ~3.35 TB/s, ~700 W, NVSwitch all-to-all. PCIe: 80 GB, lower bandwidth, ~350 W, standard servers.","SXM：80 GB HBM3、~3.35 TB/s、~700 W、NVSwitch 全互联。PCIe：80 GB、更低带宽、~350 W、标准服务器。"],
["H100 NVL","","PCIe H100 for LLM inference, paired via NVLink bridge, with more memory (94 GB per card).","面向 LLM 推理的 PCIe 版 H100，成对用 NVLink bridge 连接，显存更大（94 GB/卡）。"],
["H200","","Hopper with 141 GB HBM3e and ~4.8 TB/s. Mainly more memory and bandwidth than H100, which helps LLM inference.","Hopper 架构，141 GB HBM3e、~4.8 TB/s。相比 H100 主要提升显存容量和带宽，利好 LLM 推理。"],
["Grace CPU","","NVIDIA's Arm-based data center CPU with LPDDR5X memory and high efficiency.","NVIDIA 的 Arm 架构数据中心 CPU，LPDDR5X 内存，高能效。"],
["GH200 Grace Hopper Superchip","","Grace CPU + H100/H200 GPU over coherent NVLink-C2C (900 GB/s); the GPU can access large CPU memory directly.","Grace CPU + H100/H200 GPU，通过 NVLink-C2C（900 GB/s）一致性互联，GPU 可直接访问大容量 CPU 内存。"],
["Blackwell (B200, 2024)","","2nd-gen Transformer Engine (FP4/FP6), NVLink 5 (1.8 TB/s), dual-die design, RAS engine, decompression engine.","第二代 Transformer Engine（FP4/FP6）、NVLink 5（1.8 TB/s）、双芯片设计、RAS 引擎、解压引擎。"],
["B200 memory","B200 显存","About 180–192 GB HBM3e at ~8 TB/s; a DGX B200 has 1,440 GB across 8 GPUs.","约 180–192 GB HBM3e、~8 TB/s；DGX B200 整机 8 卡共 1,440 GB。"],
["GB200 Superchip","","1 Grace CPU + 2 B200 GPUs connected by NVLink-C2C.","1 颗 Grace CPU + 2 颗 B200 GPU，NVLink-C2C 连接。"],
["GB200 NVL72","","Liquid-cooled rack: 36 Grace CPUs + 72 Blackwell GPUs in one NVLink domain, acting like one giant GPU for trillion-parameter LLMs.","液冷机柜：36 Grace + 72 Blackwell GPU，在同一个 NVLink 域内，像一块巨型 GPU，面向万亿参数 LLM。"],
["Blackwell Ultra (B300 / GB300)","","Enhanced Blackwell with larger HBM3e (~288 GB) and stronger FP4 inference.","Blackwell 增强版：更大 HBM3e（约 288 GB）、更强 FP4 推理。"],
["Rubin / Vera Rubin","","The GPU architecture after Blackwell (Vera is the companion CPU). Roadmap level; know the name only.","Blackwell 之后的 GPU 架构代号（Vera 为配套 CPU）。路线图级别，了解即可。"],
["Data center GPUs vs consumer GPUs","数据中心卡 vs 消费级卡","Data center: ECC, MIG, NVLink/NVSwitch, long-term driver support, 24×7 design, full DCGM support. Consumer (GeForce) cards are not built for data center deployment.","数据中心卡：ECC、MIG、NVLink/NVSwitch、长期驱动支持、7×24 设计、DCGM 完整支持。消费卡（GeForce）不面向数据中心部署。"],
["RTX PRO professional GPUs","RTX PRO 专业卡","Workstation cards for graphics + AI (formerly Quadro), supporting vGPU virtual workstation use.","面向工作站和图形 + AI 的专业卡（原 Quadro 系列），支持 vGPU 图形工作站场景。"],
["Jetson (Orin / Thor)","","Embedded edge AI modules for robots, drones, and smart cameras.","嵌入式边缘 AI 模组，用于机器人、无人机、智能摄像头。"],
["DGX Spark / DGX Station","","Desktop AI development machines (Grace Blackwell) for local prototyping before moving to the data center.","桌面级 AI 开发机（Grace Blackwell），本地原型开发后再迁移到数据中心。"],
["\"First introduced in\" cheat sheet","“首次引入”速记","NVLink = Pascal; Tensor Core = Volta; RT Core = Turing; MIG/TF32/sparsity = Ampere; FP8 Transformer Engine = Hopper; FP4/NVLink 5 = Blackwell.","NVLink=Pascal；Tensor Core=Volta；RT Core=Turing；MIG/TF32/稀疏=Ampere；FP8 Transformer Engine=Hopper；FP4/NVLink5=Blackwell。"],
]});

AIIO_DECKS.push({key:"precision", d:1, name:"数值精度与量化", en:"Numeric precision & quantization", cards:[
["FP64","双精度浮点","Double precision. Required for scientific computing/HPC; rarely used in DL.","双精度。科学计算/HPC 必需，深度学习基本不用。"],
["FP32","单精度浮点","Single precision: 8 exponent + 23 mantissa bits. Traditional training baseline; holds master weights in mixed precision.","单精度，8 位指数 + 23 位尾数。传统训练基线，混合精度中保存主权重。"],
["TF32","","Ampere Tensor Core math mode: 8-bit exponent (FP32 range) + 10-bit mantissa. Speeds up FP32 code with no code changes.","Ampere 引入的 Tensor Core 计算模式：8 位指数（同 FP32 范围）+ 10 位尾数。FP32 代码无需修改即可加速。"],
["BF16 (bfloat16)","","16 bits: 8 exponent + 7 mantissa bits. Same dynamic range as FP32, stable training, usually no loss scaling needed.","16 位：8 位指数 + 7 位尾数。与 FP32 动态范围相同，训练稳定，一般不需要 loss scaling。"],
["FP16 (half precision)","半精度","16 bits: 5 exponent + 10 mantissa bits. More precision than BF16 but smaller range; training needs loss scaling to avoid underflow.","16 位：5 位指数 + 10 位尾数。精度比 BF16 高但范围小，训练需要 loss scaling 防下溢。"],
["FP8 (E4M3 / E5M2)","","Introduced with Hopper. E4M3 has more precision (often forward pass); E5M2 has more range (often gradients). Managed by the Transformer Engine.","Hopper 引入。E4M3 精度高（常用于前向），E5M2 范围大（常用于梯度）。由 Transformer Engine 管理。"],
["FP4 / NVFP4","","4-bit floating point supported by Blackwell, mainly for inference, with block-level scale factors to preserve accuracy.","Blackwell 支持的 4 位浮点，主要用于推理，配合块级缩放因子保持精度。"],
["FP6","","6-bit floating point supported by Blackwell, between FP8 and FP4.","Blackwell 支持的 6 位浮点格式，介于 FP8 和 FP4 之间。"],
["INT8","","8-bit integer, common for inference quantization; requires calibration to set scale factors.","8 位整数，推理量化常用；需要校准（calibration）确定缩放因子。"],
["INT4","","4-bit integer, common for LLM weight quantization (AWQ, GPTQ); 1/4 the memory of FP16.","4 位整数，LLM 权重量化常用（如 AWQ、GPTQ），显存减为 FP16 的 1/4。"],
["Mixed precision training","混合精度训练","Matrix math in FP16/BF16 on Tensor Cores while keeping FP32 master weights: faster, less memory, accuracy essentially unchanged.","矩阵运算用 FP16/BF16（Tensor Core 加速），保留 FP32 主权重。更快、更省显存、精度基本不变。"],
["Automatic Mixed Precision (AMP)","自动混合精度","The framework picks each operator's precision automatically, e.g., PyTorch torch.autocast.","框架自动选择每个算子的精度，例如 PyTorch torch.autocast。"],
["Loss scaling","损失缩放","In FP16 training, multiply the loss by a factor so small gradients don't underflow to zero, then unscale before the update.","FP16 训练时把损失乘一个系数，防止小梯度下溢为 0，更新前再缩回。"],
["Transformer Engine","","Hopper/Blackwell hardware+software feature that dynamically picks FP8 (or FP4) vs higher precision per layer and manages scale factors.","Hopper/Blackwell 的软硬件结合特性，按层动态选择 FP8（或 FP4）与更高精度，并管理缩放因子。"],
["Quantization","量化","Converting weights/activations from high to low precision (FP8/INT8/INT4/FP4): less memory, more throughput, possible small accuracy loss.","把权重/激活从高精度转为低精度（FP8/INT8/INT4/FP4）：显存↓、吞吐↑，可能有少量精度损失。"],
["Post-Training Quantization (PTQ)","训练后量化","Quantize directly after training using a small calibration set; low cost.","训练完直接量化，用少量校准数据，成本低。"],
["Quantization-Aware Training (QAT)","量化感知训练","Simulates quantization error during training; smaller accuracy loss but requires extra training.","训练时模拟量化误差，精度损失更小但需要再训练。"],
["Calibration","校准","Uses representative data to measure activation ranges and set quantization scale factors. Needed for TensorRT INT8.","用代表性数据统计激活分布，确定量化缩放因子。TensorRT INT8 需要。"],
["Bytes per parameter","每参数字节数","FP32 = 4, FP16/BF16 = 2, FP8/INT8 = 1, INT4/FP4 = 0.5.","FP32 = 4，FP16/BF16 = 2，FP8/INT8 = 1，INT4/FP4 = 0.5。"],
["Cost of lower precision","低精度的代价","Less dynamic range or resolution, which can hurt convergence or accuracy; compensate with scaling, calibration, or QAT.","动态范围或分辨率下降，可能影响收敛或精度；需要缩放、校准或 QAT 补偿。"],
]});

AIIO_DECKS.push({key:"sw-stack", d:1, name:"NVIDIA 软件栈", en:"NVIDIA software stack", cards:[
["GPU software stack layers (bottom to top)","GPU 软件栈分层（自下而上）","GPU driver → CUDA (runtime + CUDA-X libraries) → frameworks (PyTorch/TF/JAX) → platforms and services (NGC, AI Enterprise, NIM) → applications.","GPU 驱动 → CUDA（运行时 + CUDA-X 库）→ 框架（PyTorch/TF/JAX）→ 平台与服务（NGC、AI Enterprise、NIM）→ 应用。"],
["NVIDIA GPU driver","NVIDIA GPU 驱动","Kernel modules + user-space libraries that let the OS and apps use the GPU. The only NVIDIA component required on the host for containerized workloads.","内核模块 + 用户态库，让操作系统和应用使用 GPU。宿主机上唯一必须安装的 NVIDIA 组件（容器场景）。"],
["CUDA","","NVIDIA's parallel computing platform and programming model, including compiler, runtime, libraries, and tools.","NVIDIA 的并行计算平台与编程模型，包含编译器、运行时、库和工具。"],
["CUDA Toolkit","CUDA 工具包","Developer kit: nvcc compiler, CUDA runtime, math libraries, cuda-gdb, Nsight tools. Not needed on the host to run containerized apps.","开发套件：nvcc 编译器、CUDA 运行时、数学库、cuda-gdb、Nsight 工具。运行容器化应用时宿主机不需要安装。"],
["nvcc","","The CUDA C/C++ compiler. The W1 benchmarks in this repo were compiled with nvcc.","CUDA C/C++ 编译器。本仓库 W1 的 benchmark 就是用 nvcc 编译的。"],
["CUDA-X","","Umbrella name for NVIDIA's CUDA-based acceleration libraries and tools (cuBLAS, cuDNN, NCCL, RAPIDS, etc.).","NVIDIA 基于 CUDA 的加速库和工具集合的统称（cuBLAS、cuDNN、NCCL、RAPIDS 等）。"],
["cuBLAS","","GPU-accelerated basic linear algebra library (GEMM and more).","GPU 加速的基础线性代数库（矩阵乘 GEMM 等）。"],
["cuDNN","","Library of deep neural network primitives: convolution, attention, normalization, activations. Called by frameworks under the hood.","深度神经网络原语库：卷积、注意力、归一化、激活等。框架底层调用。"],
["NCCL","","NVIDIA Collective Communications Library (\"nickel\"): all-reduce, all-gather, broadcast across GPUs and nodes.","NVIDIA Collective Communications Library（读作 nickel）：all-reduce、all-gather、broadcast 等多 GPU/多节点集合通信。"],
["cuFFT / cuSPARSE / cuRAND / cuSOLVER","","GPU-accelerated libraries for FFT, sparse matrices, random numbers, and linear solvers.","分别为 GPU 加速的快速傅里叶变换、稀疏矩阵、随机数、线性方程求解库。"],
["CUTLASS","","CUDA C++ template library for writing high-performance custom matrix-multiply kernels.","CUDA C++ 模板库，用于编写高性能自定义矩阵乘 kernel。"],
["Nsight Systems","","System-wide profiler: CPU/GPU timeline to find I/O, synchronization, and gaps between kernels.","系统级性能分析：CPU/GPU 时间线，找出 IO、同步、kernel 间空隙等瓶颈。"],
["Nsight Compute","","Kernel-level profiler: occupancy, memory access, and instruction details of a single CUDA kernel.","Kernel 级性能分析：单个 CUDA kernel 的占用率、访存、指令细节。"],
["TensorRT","","Inference optimizer + runtime: layer fusion, precision calibration (FP16/INT8/FP8), kernel auto-tuning; produces an optimized engine.","推理优化器 + 运行时：层融合、精度校准（FP16/INT8/FP8）、kernel 自动调优，生成优化后的 engine。"],
["Portability of a TensorRT engine","TensorRT engine 的可移植性","An engine (plan file) is tied to the GPU architecture and TensorRT version; changing GPU type or upgrading usually requires a rebuild.","engine（plan 文件）与 GPU 架构和 TensorRT 版本绑定，换卡型或升级版本通常要重新构建。"],
["trtexec","","TensorRT command-line tool for converting ONNX to an engine and benchmarking it.","TensorRT 命令行工具，用于把 ONNX 转成 engine 并做性能测试。"],
["TensorRT-LLM","","Library optimized for LLM inference: in-flight batching, paged KV cache, quantization (FP8/INT4/FP4), tensor parallelism.","专为 LLM 推理优化的库：in-flight batching、paged KV cache、量化（FP8/INT4/FP4）、张量并行。"],
["TensorRT Model Optimizer","","Library for quantization, pruning, distillation, and sparsity that outputs models deployable with TensorRT-LLM.","模型量化、剪枝、蒸馏、稀疏化的工具库，产出可供 TensorRT-LLM 部署的模型。"],
["Triton Inference Server","Triton 推理服务器","Open-source serving software: multiple framework backends, dynamic batching, concurrent models, model repository, HTTP/gRPC, Prometheus metrics.","开源推理服务软件：多框架后端、动态批处理、多模型并发、模型仓库、HTTP/gRPC、Prometheus 指标。"],
["Triton default ports","Triton 默认端口","HTTP 8000, gRPC 8001, Prometheus metrics 8002.","HTTP 8000、gRPC 8001、Prometheus 指标 8002。"],
["Triton dynamic batching","Triton 动态批处理","The server merges independent requests into one batch automatically to raise throughput.","服务端把多个独立请求自动合并成一个 batch 执行，提高吞吐。"],
["Triton model repository","Triton 模型仓库","Directory-based model store (model name/version/config.pbtxt) that Triton loads at startup.","按目录组织的模型存储（模型名/版本/配置 config.pbtxt），Triton 启动时加载。"],
["Triton ensemble","Triton 模型组合","Chains preprocessing, model inference, and postprocessing into one server-side pipeline.","把预处理、模型推理、后处理串成一个流水线，在服务端一次完成。"],
["perf_analyzer / Model Analyzer","","Triton's load-testing tool / tool that searches for the best model configuration (batch size, instance count).","Triton 的压测工具 / 自动搜索最佳模型配置（batch、实例数）的工具。"],
["NVIDIA Dynamo","","Open-source framework for large-scale distributed LLM serving, with prefill/decode disaggregation and KV-cache-aware routing.","面向大规模分布式 LLM 推理的开源服务框架，支持 prefill/decode 分离、KV cache 感知路由。"],
["NVIDIA Inference Microservices (NIM)","NVIDIA 推理微服务","Prepackaged, pre-optimized inference containers exposing standard (OpenAI-compatible) APIs; deploy quickly on any NVIDIA GPU environment.","预打包、预优化的推理微服务容器，提供标准（OpenAI 兼容）API，可在任何 NVIDIA GPU 环境快速部署。"],
["Which engine runs inside a NIM?","NIM 内部用什么引擎","It selects an optimized backend per model and GPU, such as TensorRT-LLM or vLLM; transparent to the user.","按模型和 GPU 自动选择优化后端，例如 TensorRT-LLM、vLLM 等；对使用者透明。"],
["NeMo","","Framework to build, customize, and deploy generative AI: data curation, training, fine-tuning, evaluation, guardrails.","构建、定制、部署生成式 AI 的框架：数据整理、训练、微调、评估、护栏。"],
["NeMo Curator","","GPU-accelerated large-scale training-data curation: deduplication, filtering, classification.","大规模训练数据整理工具：去重、过滤、分类，GPU 加速。"],
["NeMo Guardrails","","Adds programmable guardrails to LLM apps: topic control, safety, fact checking.","给 LLM 应用加可编程护栏：话题限制、安全、事实核查。"],
["NeMo Retriever","","Collection of retrieval microservices for RAG (embedding, reranking), delivered as NIMs.","面向 RAG 的检索微服务集合（embedding、reranking），以 NIM 形式提供。"],
["Megatron-LM / Megatron-Core","","NVIDIA's large-scale Transformer training library implementing tensor, pipeline, and sequence parallelism.","NVIDIA 的大规模 Transformer 训练库，实现张量/流水线/序列并行。"],
["Nemotron","","NVIDIA's family of open models (LLMs, reasoning models) that can be customized with NeMo.","NVIDIA 发布的开放模型家族（LLM、推理模型），可用 NeMo 定制。"],
["RAPIDS","","GPU-accelerated data science suite: cuDF (pandas-like), cuML (scikit-learn-like), cuGraph (graph analytics), cuVS (vector search).","GPU 加速数据科学套件：cuDF（类 pandas）、cuML（类 scikit-learn）、cuGraph（图分析）、cuVS（向量搜索）。"],
["cuDF","","GPU DataFrame library with a pandas-like API; cudf.pandas mode accelerates pandas code with zero changes.","GPU DataFrame 库，API 类似 pandas；cudf.pandas 模式可零代码修改加速。"],
["cuML","","GPU-accelerated classical ML algorithms with a scikit-learn-like API.","GPU 加速的传统机器学习算法库，API 类似 scikit-learn。"],
["Spark RAPIDS Accelerator","","Plugin that runs Apache Spark SQL/DataFrame jobs on GPUs.","让 Apache Spark SQL/DataFrame 作业在 GPU 上运行的插件。"],
["Dask","","Python parallel computing framework; with RAPIDS it scales data processing across GPUs and nodes.","Python 并行计算框架，与 RAPIDS 结合实现多 GPU/多节点数据处理。"],
["DALI","","Data Loading Library: decodes and augments data on the GPU to remove the CPU preprocessing bottleneck.","Data Loading Library：在 GPU 上做数据解码与增强，解决 CPU 预处理瓶颈。"],
["NGC Catalog","NGC 目录","NVIDIA's hub for GPU-optimized software: framework containers (monthly), pretrained models, Helm charts, SDKs.","NVIDIA GPU 优化软件中心：框架容器（每月更新）、预训练模型、Helm chart、SDK。"],
["nvcr.io","","NGC's container registry, e.g., nvcr.io/nvidia/pytorch:24.05-py3.","NGC 的容器镜像仓库地址，例如 nvcr.io/nvidia/pytorch:24.05-py3。"],
["NGC container tag YY.MM","NGC 容器标签 YY.MM","e.g., 24.05 = May 2024 release; monthly, tested combinations of framework + CUDA + libraries.","如 24.05 表示 2024 年 5 月版本，每月发布，经过测试的框架 + CUDA + 库组合。"],
["NGC API key","NGC API 密钥","Key required to pull restricted images and models (e.g., NIM) from NGC.","从 NGC 拉取受限镜像/模型（如 NIM）需要的密钥。"],
["NVIDIA AI Enterprise","","Enterprise AI software suite including NIM, NeMo, Triton, RAPIDS, with enterprise support, security patches, and stable branches; licensed per GPU.","企业级 AI 软件套件：包含 NIM、NeMo、Triton、RAPIDS 等，提供企业支持、安全补丁、稳定分支；按 GPU 授权。"],
["Value of NVIDIA AI Enterprise","AI Enterprise 的价值","Production support (SLA), security fixes, long-term stable API branches, compatibility on certified systems and clouds.","生产级支持（SLA）、安全漏洞修复、长期稳定的 API 分支、在认证系统/云上的兼容性保证。"],
["Magnum IO","","Umbrella name for data center I/O acceleration: GPUDirect RDMA/Storage, NCCL, NVSHMEM, UCX, in-network computing.","数据中心 IO 加速栈的统称：GPUDirect RDMA/Storage、NCCL、NVSHMEM、UCX、网络在网计算等。"],
["NVSHMEM","","OpenSHMEM implementation for GPU clusters; GPUs can initiate reads/writes to remote GPU memory directly.","面向 GPU 集群的 OpenSHMEM 实现，GPU 可直接发起对远端 GPU 内存的读写。"],
["UCX","","Unified Communication X: high-performance communication framework that lets MPI, Spark, etc. use RDMA/GPUDirect.","Unified Communication X：高性能通信框架，MPI、Spark 等可通过它使用 RDMA/GPUDirect。"],
["PyTorch / TensorFlow / JAX","","Mainstream deep learning frameworks; all use NVIDIA GPUs through CUDA, cuDNN, and NCCL.","主流深度学习框架，均通过 CUDA、cuDNN、NCCL 使用 NVIDIA GPU。"],
["ONNX","","Open model exchange format: export models from any framework and run them with TensorRT or ONNX Runtime.","开放模型交换格式，可把不同框架训练的模型导出，再给 TensorRT/ONNX Runtime 推理。"],
["NVIDIA HPC SDK","","Suite of HPC compilers (nvc/nvfortran), math libraries, and communication libraries.","HPC 编译器（nvc/nvfortran）、数学库、通信库的套件。"],
["Driver branches: Production / New Feature / LTSB","驱动分支：生产 / 新特性 / 长期支持","Production Branch: stable with long-term fixes; New Feature Branch: newer features; LTSB: long-term support branch for stability-critical environments.","生产分支：稳定、长期修复；新特性分支：较新功能；LTSB：长期支持分支，适合要求稳定的环境。"],
["Data Center driver vs Game Ready driver","数据中心驱动 vs 游戏驱动","Data Center drivers target data center GPUs and are enterprise-validated; Game Ready drivers target gaming cards.","数据中心驱动面向 Tesla/数据中心 GPU，经过企业验证；Game Ready 面向游戏卡。"],
["Open GPU kernel modules","开源 GPU 内核模块","NVIDIA's open-source Linux GPU kernel modules; available from Turing on and required from Blackwell on.","NVIDIA 开源的 Linux GPU 内核模块，Turing 及以后可用，Blackwell 起为必需。"],
["GPU System Processor (GSP)","GPU 系统处理器","A RISC-V processor on the GPU that handles part of driver initialization and management (GSP firmware).","GPU 上的 RISC-V 处理器，承担驱动部分初始化和管理工作（GSP 固件）。"],
]});

AIIO_DECKS.push({key:"parallel", d:1, name:"分布式训练与集合通信", en:"Distributed training & collectives", cards:[
["Data parallelism","数据并行","Each GPU holds a full model copy and gets a slice of the mini-batch; gradients are averaged with all-reduce after backward. The most common approach.","每张 GPU 一份完整模型，切分 mini-batch；反向后 all-reduce 平均梯度。最常用的并行方式。"],
["Model parallelism","模型并行","Splits the model itself across GPUs when it doesn't fit in one GPU's memory; includes tensor and pipeline parallelism.","把模型本身切到多张 GPU 上，用于模型放不进单卡显存的情况，包括张量并行和流水线并行。"],
["Tensor parallelism","张量并行","Splits matrices within a layer across GPUs; communicates every layer, so it is usually kept inside a node's NVLink domain.","把单层内的矩阵切分到多 GPU，每层都要通信，通信极频繁 → 一般限制在节点内 NVLink 域。"],
["Pipeline parallelism","流水线并行","Splits layers into stages on different GPUs and uses micro-batches to fill the pipeline and reduce bubbles.","按层把模型分成多个 stage 放在不同 GPU，用 micro-batch 填充流水线减少气泡。"],
["Pipeline bubble","流水线气泡","Idle time of some stages at the start and end of a pipeline; more micro-batches shrink its share.","流水线开始和结束时部分 stage 空闲的时间，micro-batch 越多气泡占比越小。"],
["Sequence / context parallelism","序列 / 上下文并行","Splits activations along the sequence dimension to handle very long contexts.","沿序列长度切分激活，处理超长上下文。"],
["Expert parallelism","专家并行","Places different MoE experts on different GPUs; requires all-to-all communication.","MoE 模型中把不同专家放到不同 GPU，需要 all-to-all 通信。"],
["3D parallelism","3D 并行","Combining data + tensor + pipeline parallelism; standard for large-model training (e.g., Megatron).","数据 + 张量 + 流水线并行组合，大模型训练的常规做法（如 Megatron）。"],
["ZeRO (DeepSpeed)","","Shards optimizer states (stage 1), gradients (stage 2), and parameters (stage 3) across GPUs to remove redundant memory.","把优化器状态（stage 1）、梯度（stage 2）、参数（stage 3）分片到各 GPU，减少冗余显存。"],
["Fully Sharded Data Parallel (FSDP)","全分片数据并行","PyTorch's fully sharded data parallelism; same idea as ZeRO-3.","PyTorch 的全分片数据并行，思路同 ZeRO-3。"],
["All-reduce","全归约","Sums (or averages) data from all GPUs and gives every GPU the full result. Used to sync gradients in data parallelism.","所有 GPU 的数据求和（或平均）后，每个 GPU 都得到完整结果。数据并行同步梯度用。"],
["All-gather","全收集","Each GPU contributes a piece; every GPU ends up with all pieces concatenated.","每个 GPU 贡献一部分，最终每个 GPU 都拿到全部拼接结果。"],
["Reduce-scatter","归约-分散","Reduces first, then scatters result shards to GPUs. All-reduce = reduce-scatter + all-gather.","先归约，再把结果分片发给各 GPU。all-reduce = reduce-scatter + all-gather。"],
["Broadcast","广播","One GPU sends data to all GPUs (e.g., syncing initial weights).","一个 GPU 把数据发给所有 GPU（如初始权重同步）。"],
["All-to-all","全交换","Every GPU sends different data to every other GPU; common in MoE expert parallelism and heavy on the network.","每个 GPU 给其他每个 GPU 发不同数据；MoE 专家并行常用，对网络压力大。"],
["Ring all-reduce","环形全归约","GPUs form a ring and pass segments along; good bandwidth use, latency grows linearly with GPU count.","GPU 排成环逐段传递，带宽利用好，延迟随 GPU 数线性增长。"],
["Tree all-reduce","树形全归约","Tree-shaped reduction; latency grows logarithmically, good for large scale and small messages. NCCL picks ring or tree automatically.","树形归约，延迟随 GPU 数对数增长，适合大规模、小消息。NCCL 会自动选 ring 或 tree。"],
["nccl-tests","","Official NCCL benchmarks such as all_reduce_perf, reporting algbw and busbw.","NCCL 官方性能测试工具，如 all_reduce_perf，报告 algbw 和 busbw。"],
["algbw vs busbw","算法带宽 vs 总线带宽","algbw = data size ÷ time; busbw corrects for the algorithm to reflect actual link bandwidth, comparable to NVLink/NIC specs.","algbw = 数据量 ÷ 时间；busbw 按算法修正后反映硬件链路实际带宽，可与 NVLink/网卡理论值对比。"],
["Strong scaling vs weak scaling","强扩展 vs 弱扩展","Strong: fixed total problem, add GPUs to go faster. Weak: fixed work per GPU, problem grows with GPU count.","强扩展：总问题规模不变、加 GPU 看提速；弱扩展：每 GPU 负载不变、加 GPU 同时扩大问题。"],
["Scaling efficiency","扩展效率","Actual speedup on N GPUs ÷ N. Drops due to communication overhead, insufficient network bandwidth, I/O, or load imbalance.","N 张 GPU 的实际加速比 ÷ N。下降常因通信开销、网络带宽不足、IO 或负载不均。"],
["Gang scheduling","成组调度","All processes of a distributed job must get resources at the same time or none start; native in Slurm.","分布式作业的所有进程必须同时获得资源才能启动，否则全部等待；Slurm 原生支持。"],
["Gradient accumulation","梯度累积","Accumulates gradients over several small batches before one update, emulating a large batch with little memory.","多个小 batch 累积梯度后再更新一次，用小显存模拟大 batch。"],
["Activation checkpointing","激活重计算","Skips storing some activations in the forward pass and recomputes them in backward, trading compute for memory.","前向时不保存部分激活，反向时重新计算，用计算换显存。"],
["Training memory estimate (Adam, mixed precision)","训练显存估算（Adam 混合精度）","~16 bytes/parameter (FP16 weights 2 + grads 2 + FP32 master 4 + two Adam states 8), excluding activations. 7B model ≈ 112 GB.","约 16 字节/参数（FP16 权重 2 + 梯度 2 + FP32 主权重 4 + Adam 两份状态 8），还不含激活。7B 模型约 112 GB。"],
["Inference memory estimate","推理显存估算","Weights = parameters × bytes per parameter (70B × 2 B = 140 GB), plus KV cache and activations.","权重 = 参数量 × 每参数字节（70B × 2 B = 140 GB），再加 KV cache 和激活。"],
["Model FLOPs Utilization (MFU)","模型算力利用率","Achieved model FLOPS ÷ hardware peak FLOPS; a common training-efficiency metric.","实际达到的模型 FLOPS ÷ 硬件峰值 FLOPS，衡量训练效率的常用指标。"],
["MPI","消息传递接口","Message Passing Interface: HPC multi-process communication standard; mpirun launches multi-node jobs and works with NCCL.","Message Passing Interface：HPC 多进程通信标准，常用 mpirun 启动多节点作业，可与 NCCL 配合。"],
["torchrun","","PyTorch's distributed launcher: starts one process per GPU and sets rank environment variables.","PyTorch 分布式启动器，为每张 GPU 起一个进程并设置 rank 等环境变量。"],
["Rank / world size","进程编号 / 进程总数","Each process's ID / total process count in distributed training. Local rank is the ID within a node.","分布式训练中每个进程的编号 / 进程总数。local rank 是节点内编号。"],
]});

AIIO_DECKS.push({key:"genai", d:1, name:"生成式 AI 与 LLM 推理", en:"Generative AI & LLM inference", cards:[
["Large language model (LLM)","大语言模型","A Transformer-based model trained on massive text that understands and generates language; billions to trillions of parameters.","基于 Transformer、在海量文本上训练、能理解和生成语言的模型，参数量从数十亿到万亿。"],
["Token","词元","The basic unit of text a model processes (word or subword). In English, 1 token ≈ 0.75 words. Billing and performance are measured in tokens.","模型处理文本的基本单位（词或子词）。英文约 1 token ≈ 0.75 个单词。计费和性能都按 token 计。"],
["Tokenizer","分词器","Splits text into tokens and maps them to IDs.","把文本切成 token 并映射为 ID 的组件。"],
["Context window","上下文窗口","Maximum tokens the model handles at once (input + output). Longer context means a larger KV cache.","模型一次能处理的最大 token 数（输入 + 输出）。越长 KV cache 越大。"],
["Embedding","嵌入向量","Maps text/images to dense vectors where similar meanings are close together. Used for retrieval and RAG.","把文本/图像映射成稠密向量，语义相近的内容向量距离近。用于检索和 RAG。"],
["Prompt engineering","提示词工程","Steering model output by designing the input prompt (instructions, examples, format) without changing weights.","通过设计输入提示词（指令、示例、格式）来引导模型输出，不改变权重。"],
["Few-shot / zero-shot","少样本 / 零样本","Giving a few examples / no examples in the prompt for the model to complete the task.","在 prompt 中给几个示例 / 不给示例直接让模型完成任务。"],
["Temperature","温度","Sampling randomness. Low → more deterministic; high → more varied.","采样随机度。低 → 输出更确定；高 → 更多样。"],
["Top-p / top-k sampling","Top-p / Top-k 采样","Sample only from tokens within cumulative probability p or the k most likely tokens, controlling diversity.","只从累计概率前 p 或概率最高的 k 个 token 中采样，控制多样性。"],
["Hallucination","幻觉","The model produces plausible but false content. Mitigate with RAG, guardrails, fact checking.","模型生成看似合理但不真实的内容。缓解：RAG、护栏、事实校验。"],
["Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)","检索增强生成","Chunk docs → embed → store in a vector DB; at query time retrieve relevant chunks into the prompt. First choice when data changes often and you don't want to retrain.","文档切块 → embedding → 存入向量库；提问时检索相关片段拼入 prompt 再生成。数据经常变、不想重训时首选。"],
["RAG pipeline components","RAG 的流程组件","Document parsing and chunking → embedding model → vector database → retrieval (+ reranker) → LLM generation.","文档解析与切块 → embedding 模型 → 向量数据库 → 检索（+ reranker 重排）→ LLM 生成。"],
["Vector database","向量数据库","Stores embeddings and retrieves by vector similarity (e.g., Milvus). GPU acceleration via cuVS.","存储 embedding，按向量相似度检索（如 Milvus）。GPU 加速可用 cuVS。"],
["Reranker","重排序模型","Rescores and reorders initial retrieval results to improve the relevance of RAG context.","对初步检索结果重新打分排序，提高 RAG 上下文的相关性。"],
["Chunking","切块","Splitting long documents into suitably sized pieces before embedding; affects retrieval quality.","把长文档切成合适长度的片段再做 embedding，影响检索质量。"],
["Supervised fine-tuning (SFT)","监督微调","Fine-tuning on instruction–response pairs so the model learns to follow instructions.","用指令-回答对数据微调模型，让它学会遵循指令。"],
["RLHF","基于人类反馈的强化学习","Reinforcement learning from human feedback: train a reward model on human preferences, then optimize the LLM toward them.","基于人类反馈的强化学习：用人类偏好训练奖励模型，再优化 LLM，使输出更符合人类偏好。"],
["Parameter-efficient fine-tuning (PEFT)","参数高效微调","Trains only a small number of extra parameters with the main model frozen. LoRA, P-tuning, and adapters are examples.","只训练少量额外参数，冻结主模型。LoRA、P-tuning、Adapter 都属于此类。"],
["LoRA","低秩适配","Low-Rank Adaptation: freezes the original weights and trains small low-rank matrices added to layers. Far cheaper than full fine-tuning.","Low-Rank Adaptation：冻结原权重，训练小的低秩矩阵加到原层上。显存和成本远低于全量微调。"],
["Full fine-tuning","全量微调","Updates all parameters; highest ceiling but memory and compute costs approach a share of pretraining.","更新所有参数，效果上限高，但显存和算力成本接近预训练规模的一部分。"],
["RAG vs fine-tuning: how to choose","RAG 与微调怎么选","Frequently changing knowledge or need for citations → RAG; changing style/format/specific skills → fine-tuning; they can be combined.","知识频繁变化、需要引用来源 → RAG；改变风格/格式/特定能力 → 微调；二者可结合。"],
["Mixture of Experts (MoE)","混合专家模型","Each layer has many expert subnetworks and each token activates only a few: huge total parameters, small per-token compute.","每层有多个专家子网络，每个 token 只激活其中少数，总参数大而单 token 计算量小。"],
["Prefill vs decode","预填充 vs 解码","Prefill processes the whole prompt at once (compute-bound); decode generates tokens one by one (memory-bandwidth-bound).","Prefill：一次性处理整个输入 prompt，计算密集；Decode：逐个生成 token，受显存带宽限制。"],
["KV cache","键值缓存","Caches attention keys/values already computed to avoid recomputation; grows linearly with context length and concurrency and uses lots of memory.","缓存注意力层已算过的 Key/Value，避免重复计算；随上下文长度和并发数线性增长，吃大量显存。"],
["Paged attention / paged KV cache","分页注意力 / 分页 KV 缓存","Manages KV cache in pages like an OS, reducing fragmentation and increasing concurrency (vLLM and TensorRT-LLM support it).","像操作系统分页一样管理 KV cache，减少显存碎片，提高并发（vLLM、TensorRT-LLM 都支持）。"],
["In-flight / continuous batching","飞行中批处理 / 连续批处理","Requests join the batch as they arrive and leave when done instead of waiting for the whole batch, greatly raising LLM serving throughput.","请求随到随加入、完成即退出 batch，而不是等整批结束，大幅提高 LLM 服务吞吐。"],
["Speculative decoding","投机解码","A small draft model proposes several tokens and the large model verifies them in one pass, cutting generation latency.","小模型先草拟多个 token，大模型一次验证，降低生成延迟。"],
["Disaggregated serving","分离式服务","Runs prefill and decode on separate GPU pools that scale independently (e.g., NVIDIA Dynamo).","把 prefill 和 decode 放到不同 GPU 池分别扩展（如 NVIDIA Dynamo）。"],
["Time to first token (TTFT)","首 token 延迟","Time from sending a request to receiving the first token; driven mainly by prefill and queuing.","从发送请求到收到第一个 token 的时间，主要受 prefill 和排队影响。"],
["TPOT / ITL","每 token 输出时间 / token 间延迟","Time Per Output Token / Inter-Token Latency: the gap between later tokens, i.e., the \"typing speed\".","Time Per Output Token / Inter-Token Latency：后续每个 token 的间隔，决定“打字速度”。"],
["End-to-end latency estimate","端到端延迟估算","≈ TTFT + TPOT × (output tokens − 1).","≈ TTFT + TPOT × (输出 token 数 − 1)。"],
["Tokens per second","每秒 token 数（吞吐）","Tokens generated per second by the whole system; depends on concurrency, batch, model size, and precision.","整机每秒生成 token 数；与并发数、batch、模型大小、精度有关。"],
["Guardrails","护栏","Checks, filters, and steers LLM behavior on input and output (safety, topics, compliance).","在输入和输出侧检查、过滤、引导 LLM 行为（安全、话题、合规）。"],
["Multimodal model","多模态模型","Handles several input/output types such as text, images, and audio (e.g., vision-language models).","能同时处理文本、图像、音频等多种输入或输出的模型（如 VLM 视觉语言模型）。"],
["Tool calling / function calling","工具调用 / 函数调用","The LLM outputs a structured call; the app runs the external tool (API, database, search) and returns the result to the model.","LLM 输出结构化调用请求，由应用执行外部工具（API、数据库、搜索）后把结果返回给模型。"],
["NVIDIA AI Blueprints","NVIDIA AI 蓝图","NVIDIA's reference generative AI workflows (RAG, digital humans, video analytics) built on NIM.","NVIDIA 提供的生成式 AI 参考工作流（如 RAG、数字人、视频分析），基于 NIM 构建。"],
["Scaling laws","缩放定律","Empirical rule that model quality improves as a power law with parameters, data, and compute; justifies ever-larger clusters.","模型效果随参数量、数据量、算力按幂律提升的经验规律，是持续扩大集群的依据。"],
["Test-time scaling / reasoning models","推理时扩展 / 推理模型","Spending more compute at inference (long chains of thought) to improve answers, which increases inference compute demand.","推理时花更多计算（长思考链）提升答案质量，推理算力需求随之增加。"],
]});

AIIO_DECKS.push({key:"industry", d:1, name:"行业方案与边缘平台", en:"Industry solutions & edge platforms", cards:[
["Omniverse","","Platform for 3D collaboration, simulation, and digital twins, built on OpenUSD.","3D 协作、仿真与数字孪生平台，基于 OpenUSD。"],
["Cosmos","","NVIDIA's world foundation model platform for physical AI (robots, autonomous vehicles).","NVIDIA 面向物理 AI（机器人、自动驾驶）的世界基础模型平台。"],
["Isaac","","Robotics development platform: simulation (Isaac Sim), perception, manipulation libraries.","机器人开发平台：仿真（Isaac Sim）、感知、操作库。"],
["Metropolis","","Vision AI / intelligent video analytics platform (smart cities, retail, factories).","智能视频分析 / 视觉 AI 平台（智慧城市、零售、工厂）。"],
["DeepStream SDK","","GPU-accelerated streaming video analytics pipeline SDK; core of Metropolis.","GPU 加速的流式视频分析管线 SDK，Metropolis 的核心组件。"],
["Clara","","Healthcare AI platform: medical imaging, genomics (Parabricks), drug discovery (BioNeMo).","医疗健康 AI 平台：医学影像、基因组学（Parabricks）、药物研发（BioNeMo）。"],
["Riva","","Speech AI SDK: automatic speech recognition (ASR), text-to-speech (TTS), translation.","语音 AI SDK：语音识别（ASR）、语音合成（TTS）、翻译。"],
["Maxine","","Audio/video enhancement SDK: noise removal, eye-contact correction, super-resolution.","音视频增强 SDK：降噪、视线校正、超分辨率等。"],
["Morpheus","","Cybersecurity AI framework for real-time anomaly detection on network traffic and logs.","网络安全 AI 框架：对网络流量、日志做实时异常检测。"],
["Merlin","","Recommender system framework with GPU acceleration across data processing, training, and inference.","推荐系统框架：数据处理、训练、推理全流程 GPU 加速。"],
["Holoscan","","Platform for real-time AI on edge sensor data (e.g., medical devices).","边缘传感器数据（医疗器械等）实时 AI 处理平台。"],
["DRIVE","","Autonomous vehicle platform (in-vehicle compute + software stack).","自动驾驶平台（车载计算 + 软件栈）。"],
["cuOpt","","GPU-accelerated combinatorial optimization solver (e.g., vehicle routing).","GPU 加速的组合优化求解器（车辆路径规划等）。"],
["CUDA-Q / cuQuantum","","Hybrid quantum-classical programming platform / quantum circuit simulation acceleration libraries.","量子-经典混合计算编程平台 / 量子电路仿真加速库。"],
["TAO Toolkit","","Low-code transfer learning tool to fine-tune vision AI models with little data.","低代码迁移学习工具，用少量数据微调视觉 AI 模型。"],
["IGX","","Edge AI platform for industrial and medical use, emphasizing functional safety and long lifecycle.","面向工业和医疗的边缘 AI 平台，强调功能安全和长生命周期。"],
["Fleet Command","","Cloud service for remotely deploying and managing edge AI (zero-touch provisioning, OTA updates, security).","边缘 AI 远程部署和管理的云服务（零接触配置、OTA 更新、安全）。"],
["Sovereign AI","主权 AI","A nation or region building AI capability on its own infrastructure, data, and talent, emphasizing data sovereignty.","国家或地区用本土基础设施、数据和人才构建 AI 能力，强调数据主权。"],
["AI factory","AI 工厂","NVIDIA's framing of the data center as a factory that produces intelligence (tokens), measured by token throughput and energy efficiency.","NVIDIA 提出的概念：把数据中心看作生产“智能”（token）的工厂，以 token 吞吐和能效衡量。"],
]});
